data: {"t":"d","text":"Saving checklists requires signing in to an account. If you’d like to save this, you can sign in or create a free account to unlock that feature. In the meantime, here’s your checklist for venue booking:\n\n1. Tour 3 venues.\n2. Request quotes from shortlisted venues.\n3. Review and sign the contract with your chosen venue.\n\nWould you like help prioritizing or scheduling these steps?","toolActions":[],"mode":"planner","detectedLanguage":"en","responseLanguage":"en","audioUrl":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrls":[],"products":[],"productsHasMore":false}

